### 인가 코드로 사진 달라고 해 보기
GET http://127.0.0.1:4001/photos
Authorization: Bearer 화면에 보인 인가 코드

### 비밀값 없이 인가 코드를 토큰으로 바꿔 보기
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code=화면에 보인 인가 코드&redirect_uri=http://localhost:4002/callback&client_id=photo-app

### dahye의 인가 코드 받기
# @no-redirect
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

response_type=code&client_id=photo-app&redirect_uri=http://localhost:4002/callback&scope=photos&username=dahye&password=dahye1234&decision=allow

### jaehoon의 인가 코드 받기
# @no-redirect
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

response_type=code&client_id=photo-app&redirect_uri=http://localhost:4002/callback&scope=photos&username=jaehoon&password=jaehoon1234&decision=allow

### jaehoon의 인가 코드 받기 (code_challenge를 담아)
# @no-redirect
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

response_type=code&client_id=photo-app&redirect_uri=http://localhost:4002/callback&scope=photos&username=jaehoon&password=jaehoon1234&decision=allow&code_challenge=E9Melhoa2OwvFrEMTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM&code_challenge_method=S256
